{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Pushed to Gerrit as change 1910 (https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/1910), commit bc7377a75c. Operator decision implemented: Makefile picks zizmor offline (portable local, --offline suppresses the misleading warning) vs online (when a GitHub token is in the env), and _build-and-test.yml supplies the read-only job token so CI runs the five token-backed audits. docs/releasing.md documents the split. make lint green (no warning). Awaiting Gerrit gates; will not close until Verified +1."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787161518775049001,"uuid":"ed8f0aca-b5ef-4f57-a2ce-a7e33d4823f7"}